 "post": {
  "instagram": "A range needs at least two touches on each side and flat highs and lows. One way to trade it: buy rejections near the low, sell rejections near the high, stop just outside, target the middle or the other side. Every range ends: a close outside means stop fading and start watching the breakout.\n\nSave this for later and follow @calmedgeofficial for one trading concept a day.\n\nEducational example on an illustrative chart. Not financial advice; trading involves risk of loss.\n\n#rangetrading #supportandresistance #priceaction #tradingeducation #technicalanalysis #daytrading #trading #learntotrade",
